1
00:00:05,701 --> 00:00:08,401
(Bernadette:)So I was taking a shower
this morning and when I got out...

2
00:00:08,571 --> 00:00:11,231
(Bernadette:)...I started to dry off
with what I thought was a towel...

3
00:00:11,407 --> 00:00:14,467
(Bernadette:)...but turned out to be
Howard's mom's underwear.

4
00:00:18,614 --> 00:00:21,104
(Bernadette:)I had to take another shower.

5
00:00:22,852 --> 00:00:25,082
(Bernadette:)It wasn't enough.

6
00:00:26,622 --> 00:00:29,252
(Bernadette:)Nothing will ever be enough.

7
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:33,590
(Amy:)I once looked in Sheldon's
underwear drawer. He yelled at me.

8
00:00:34,497 --> 00:00:38,527
(Amy:)But now I know what it looks like,
and he can never take that away.

9
00:00:38,701 --> 00:00:40,631
- There's a book under here.
- Oh. I'll get that.

10
00:00:40,803 --> 00:00:43,063
- I got it. I got it.
- No, no, it's okay.

11
00:00:43,239 --> 00:00:46,899
(Bernadette:)- Why do you have a history textbook?
- No, it's... It's not a big deal.

12
00:00:47,076 --> 00:00:49,566
(Penny:)Just taking a class
at the Pasadena Community College.

13
00:00:49,779 --> 00:00:52,539
(Bernadette:)That's great. I didn't know
you wanted to go back to school.

14
00:00:52,715 --> 00:00:54,045
(Penny:)It's just one history class.

15
00:00:54,217 --> 00:00:57,447
(Penny:)Look, I didn't finish college,
so I thought I would give it a try.

16
00:00:57,620 --> 00:01:03,020
(Amy:)Not to mention your acting career
is going south like Sherman.

